# An allowlist: only what the image build reads goes into the context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!rules.example.yaml
!src/
!voices/SHA256SUMS
# The web app, for the Node stage only (the pitwall target); the engineer's
# stages never copy it. Installed and built output stays out.
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
